    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0828" n="736" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg736"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 611.326/137</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-10T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 10, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 9, 5 p.m. You may confidentially inform President that as a special
                    concession to his wishes announcement will be withheld until Monday morning,
                    October 14, but that it will be impossible to hold it any longer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
